#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/orchestration.md:47
msgid "PortSpec and the contract boundary"
msgstr "PortSpec 与契约边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/orchestration.md:49
msgid "`PortSpec` carries identity, datatype, units, semantics, update behavior, direction, support metadata (`PORT_SUPPORT_FIELDS`), and optional DEC/IPHS structural fields. `SSOTCatalog` supplies centralized variable identity and units from `UnifiedParameterManager`-backed definitions. `ContractRegistry` is applied later by `StateManager`; GraphIR validation does not query it as a substitute for `PortSpec`."
msgstr "`PortSpec` 承载变量标识、数据类型、单位、语义、更新行为、方向、支撑域元数据（`PORT_SUPPORT_FIELDS`），以及可选的离散外微分（Discrete Exterior Calculus, DEC）与互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）结构字段。`SSOTCatalog` 基于 `UnifiedParameterManager` 支撑的定义提供集中式变量标识与单位。`ContractRegistry` 随后由状态管理器（`StateManager`）应用；GraphIR 校验阶段不通过查询它来替代 `PortSpec`。"

