#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/orchestration.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter chain shown in the figure is conceptual. With `auto_adapt=True`, the compiler automatically lowers an executable `unit_cast` adapter node only when its triple guard holds (context-free unit conversion, strict non-unit `can_connect(...)` compatibility, and identical explicit `execution_group` in `{\"fast\", \"medium\", \"slow\"}`); all other conversions must be authored explicitly."
msgstr "图中展示的适配器链为概念示意。开启 `auto_adapt=True` 时，仅当三重守卫同时成立（无上下文依赖的单位换算、非单位字段通过严格 `can_connect(...)` 兼容性检查，以及两端显式声明属于 `{\"fast\", \"medium\", \"slow\"}` 中的同一 `execution_group`），编译器才会将边下沉为可执行的 `unit_cast` 适配器节点；其余所有转换均须显式编写为图节点。"

