msgstr "Strict IPHS/DEC 边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/orchestration.md:199
msgid "Strict graphs declare only the structural operations required by their roles. Typed cochains, Hodge properties, port matching, reaction structure, entropy steps, overflow routing, state domains, and equivalence certificates are checked through existing validators."
msgstr "Strict graph 只声明其角色所需的结构操作。Typed cochains、Hodge properties、port matching、reaction structure、entropy steps、overflow routing、state domains 和 equivalence certificates 均通过现有 validators 检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/orchestration.md:204
msgid "The compiler may assemble structures only from declared information. It must not infer a missing Hamiltonian, effort, reaction affinity, conservation matrix, shared-state equivalence, or effort-flow units from empirical code."
msgstr "compiler 只能根据已声明的信息组装结构，不得从 empirical code 推断缺失的 Hamiltonian、effort、reaction affinity、conservation matrix、shared-state equivalence 或 effort-flow units。"

